OL,3,GNEWSABlack community group helps people
OL,4,Aconnect
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who founded a community group
OL,7,Ffor black people in Kent says she wants
OL,8,Fto show there is "loads going on"
OL,9,Facross the county.
OL,11,FJo Oluwo created Black Core Kent in
OL,12,FAshford in 2024 after moving from
OL,13,FLondon and wanting to help other people
OL,14,Fwho had done the same connect with each
OL,15,Fother.
OL,17,FThe group recently held a screening of
OL,18,Fa film about soul group The Real Thing
OL,19,Fas part of events celebrating Black
OL,20,FBritish music and culture.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
