OL,3,GNEWSABlack community group helps people
OL,4,Aconnect
OL,5,
OL,6,FOluwo said the community interest
OL,7,Fcompany events were helping people who
OL,8,Fhad previously felt isolated feel seen
OL,9,Fand supported.
